<title>ISRAEL: Shekem Ltd Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Shekem Ltd Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shekem Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in millions of shekels)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95	12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  270	 286	   1,131	1,135</p>
<p>Operating profit loss 20   loss 15	 loss 70    loss 52</p>
<p>Net Profit		13   loss 13		 3    loss 45</p>
<p>Note: The company reported a fourth-quarter capital gain of 48.4 million shekels from the sale of its supermarket chain.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.25 shekels on Dec 31, 1996)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
